  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">De-risking renewable energy investment (DREI) in Lebanon analysis and report</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity involves updating the De-risking Renewable Energy Investment (DREI) analysis to identify and mitigate investment risks in Lebanon&#x2019;s renewable energy sector, particularly reflecting the new Distributed Renewable Energy (DRE) Law and current market dynamics. The goal is to outline effective public interventions that reduce financial risks, thereby fostering a favorable investment climate and accelerating Lebanon&#x2019;s transition to sustainable energy solutions. This collaborative effort will leverage both local insights and international expertise to enhance the renewable energy framework and support Lebanon&apos;s green economy aspirations.</narrative>
  </description>
